@startuml
!include estilo.iuml
title Módulos de primer nivel del monorepo
package "capstone-project-documentation" {
  package "frontend\n(PWA React + TypeScript)" as FE
  package "despliegue" as DESP {
    package "gateway\n(rutas Traefik)" as GW
    package "postgres\n(5 bases y usuarios)" as PGI
    package "nube\n(HTTPS y buzón)" as NUBE
  }
  package "microservices" as MS {
    package "auth-service" as AU
    package "catalog-service" as CA
    package "reservas-service" as RE
    package "ia-service" as IA
    package "analitica-service" as AN
  }
  package "contratos" as CON {
    package "*-openapi.json" as OAS
    package "eventos\n(JSON Schema)" as EVT
  }
  package "comun\n(plantilla común)" as COM
}
FE ..> OAS : consume
GW ..> MS : enruta a
AU ..> COM
CA ..> COM
RE ..> COM
IA ..> COM
AN ..> COM
MS ..> CON : implementa
COM ..> EVT : valida el sobre
note bottom of COM : JWT ES256, outbox y relevo,\nconsumidor idempotente,\nX-Correlation-Id, logs JSON, /health
note right of DESP : docker-compose.yml (local)\ndocker-compose.nube.yml (Azure)
@enduml
